{
  "_about": "SkillTide's rules for linking a role to UN SDG targets. A role gets a target when one of its O*NET task statements matches a keyword (case-insensitive regex). The matching task is stored as the evidence, so every link can be checked by reading the task next to the target text. These rules are SkillTide's own; they are not an official UN mapping.",
